  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">Importance of Getting Vaccination to Fight COVID-19 Pandemic</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n&nbsp;\n\nIn light of spreading awareness and as an effort to ensure that all students of ATME are vaccinated, a webinar was planned and carried out on 28th June 2021 at 11:00AM. During this hour online classes for all departments were suspended to allow students to attend the Webinar. All the students joined by 11:00AM following which the webinar commenced. The event was carried out on MS Stream.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Event Report</strong>\n\n[pdf-embedder url=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Report-for-Webinar-on-Vaccination_3.pdf\"]\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
